#. Tag: author
#: obsplanner.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname>Kristian</firstname> <surname>Ivanov</surname>"
msgstr "<firstname>Kristian</firstname> <surname>Ivanov</surname>"

#. Tag: title
#: obsplanner.docbook:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Observation Planner"
msgstr "Planer observacije"

#. Tag: primary
#: obsplanner.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Planner"
msgstr "Planer"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:13
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Since &kde; SC 4.4, Prakash Mohan&apos;s GSoC work has been released in "
"&kstars;. &kstars; now has an awesome observation planner to plan your "
"observation sessions. The execute session option allows you to log "
"information about objects as you observe them. Alternately, you may also "
"write a short log in the session planner itself. We wish you a lot of fun "
"planning your observations with &kstars;!"
msgstr ""
"Budući &kde; SC 4.4, Prakash Mohan&apos;-ov GSoC rad je objavljen u "
"&kstars;. &kstars; Sada ima dobar planer za planiranje sesije promatranje."
"Izvrši sesiju opcija dopušta vam da log inforamcije o objektima kako ih "
"posmatrate. Alternativno, možete napisati kratak zapisnik na planer sesija  "
"sami. Želimo vam puno zabave u planiraju svog posmatranja s &kstars;!"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can even add some pictures to the objects. The image list is a Google "
"image search list. To add image to an object all you need to do is press "
"<guibutton>Find Image</guibutton> button on the right and then find an image "
"that you like. If you do not have an Internet connection you can open an "
"image from your hard drive. Note that images that will be used are going to "
"be cropped to 600x600 pixels."
msgstr ""
"Možete čak dodati neke slike na objektima.Popis slika Popis Google "
"pretraživanja slika. Da biste dodali sliku na objekt Sve što trebate učiniti "
"je pritisnuti <guibutton> Traži slike </guibutton> gumb na desnoj strani, a "
"zatim pronaći sliku koja vam se sviđa. Ako nemate internetsku vezu možete "
"otvoriti sliku s hard diska. Imajte na umu da su slike koje će se koristiti "
"biti smanjene na  600x600 piksela."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first way of doing this is by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>2</keycap></keycombo> or <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>L</"
"keycap></keycombo> to open the Observation List, then press the "
"<guibutton>Add Object</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Ovo radite prvi put pritiskajući  <keycombo action = \"simul\"> &Ctrl; "
"<keycap> 2 </keycap> </keycombo> ili <keycombo action = \"simul\"> &Ctrl; "
"<keycap> L </keycap> </keycombo> kako biste otvorili Popis promatranja, a "
"zatim pritisnite <guibutton> Dodaj Object </guibutton> gumb."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Save all Images</guibutton> button does a search for the SDSS "
"images and displays the DSS image if the requested RA/Dec is out of the SDSS "
"footprint."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton> Spremi sve slike </guibutton> tipka ne traži za SDSS slike i "
"prikazuje DSS sliku ako je zatraženo RA /DEC je bez SDSS traga."

#. Tag: phrase
#: obsplanner.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is an SDSS image of a galaxy"
msgstr "Ovo je  SDSS slika galaksije"

#. Tag: phrase
#: obsplanner.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "This is an DSS image of the same galaxy"
msgstr "Ovo je  DSS slika galaksije"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guibutton>Delete all Images</guibutton> button does the opposite. It "
"deletes all downloaded images."
msgstr ""
"<guibutton> Izbriši sve slike </guibutton> Tipka čini suprotno. Ona briše "
"sve preuzete slike."

#. Tag: phrase
#: obsplanner.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "The image for the galaxy is now deleted"
msgstr "Slika za galaksiju je sada obrisana"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can add more objects by pressing the <guibutton>Add Object</guibutton> "
"button. It has quite accurate method for sorting out items, depending on "
"what options you have given to him. They are: Any, Stars, Solar System, "
"Clusters (Globular and Open), Nebula (Gaseous and Planetary), Galaxies, "
"Comets, Asteroids and Constellations + the name filter."
msgstr ""
"Možete dodati više objekata pritiskom na <guibutton> Dodaj Object </"
"guibutton> gumb. To je prilično točan način za sortiranje stavki, ovisno o "
"tome što su opcije koje ste dali za njega. One su: Bilo sta, Zvijezda, "
"Sunčev sustav, Klasteri (Globularno i otvorena), Maglica (plinovitih i "
"Planetarni), galaksije, komete, asteroidi i zviježđa + naziv filtra."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can see the object visibility based on the time and date. The "
"leader line shows the time right now."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete vidjeti vidljivost objekta bazirano na datumu i vremenu. "
"Prednja linija pokazuje vrijeme sada."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "And below this you can add notes about observing this object."
msgstr "I ispod ovoga možete dodati bilješke o posmatranju objekta."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Do note that the Wish List is not the Session Plan. In the Wish List you can "
"add objects that you wish to observer at some point. From there you can add "
"them to the Session Plan."
msgstr ""
"Imajte na umu da lista  želja nije Plan sesija. U listu želja možete "
"dodavati objekte koje želite posmatrati u nekom trenutku. Od tamo možete ih "
"dodati na plan sesije."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can see the pop-up window that comes after right-clicking on an object."
msgstr "Možete vidjeti pop-up prozor nakon desnog klika na objekat."

#. Tag: phrase
#: obsplanner.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add objects to Session Plan window"
msgstr "Dodaj objekat na Plan sesije prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here is the second way of adding objects in your Observation Plan and using "
"you Observation Plan. To use this way you just need to press the 4-th icon "
"on the top-left corner of the Observation Planner Wizard (which is "
"highlighted with yellow)."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje je drugi način za dodavanje objekata u svom planu za promatranje i "
"korištenjem vam promatranje plan. Da biste koristili ovaj način samo trebate "
"pritisnuti 4-tu ikonu na gornjem lijevom uglu Planer Promatranje Čarobnjaka"
"(koji je označen sa žutom)."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Despite looking differently this way is basically the same as the first one. "
"Although that it could be a bit more detailed. Here you can see the same "
"categories of objects."
msgstr ""
"Unatoč potrazi ovaj put je u osnovi isti kao i prvi. Iako da bi to moglo "
"biti malo detaljnije. Ovdje možete vidjeti iste kategorije objekata."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose where these objects to be on the sky. There are four options "
"available for you: All over the sky (which is the default option), by "
"constellation and in a region (rectangular or circular)."
msgstr ""
"Možete birati gdje su ti objekti biti na nebu. Postoje četiri opcije "
"dostupne za vas: Sve više nebu (koja je zadana mogućnost), od konstelacija i "
"u regiji (pravokutnog ili kružnog)."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose the date for the observation and the place you are going to "
"observe from."
msgstr ""
"Možete odabrati datum posmatranja i mjesto odakle će se oni posmatrati."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:117
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can choose the treshold of magnitude for the objects to be shown. In "
"astronomy, absolute magnitude (also known as absolute visual magnitude when "
"measured in the standard V photometric band) measures a celestial "
"object&apos;s intrinsic brightness."
msgstr ""
"Ete odabrati pragu veličine za objekte koji će biti prikazan. U astronomiji, "
"apsolutna magnituda (također poznat kao apsolutne vizualne magnitude kada je "
"izmjerena u standardnim V fotometrijskog banda))mjeri nebesku object&apos;s "
"svetlinu objekta."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:128
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can save your observation plan. And it will save it with a <filename "
"class=\"extension\">.obslist</filename> extension."
msgstr ""
"Možete spremiti svoj plan promatranja. I to će ga spasiti s <filename class="
"\"extension\">.obslist</filename>produžetak."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also access the <guilabel>WUT</guilabel> (What&apos;s up tonight), "
"which could be of a great assistance to you. It can give you ideas what to "
"observe on a date, time and place that you specify using the configuration "
"buttons int the top-right corner of the <guilabel>What&apos;s up tonight</"
"guilabel> window."
msgstr ""
"Također možete pristupiti <guilabel> WUT </guilabel> (Šta&apos; ima "
"večeras), koja bi mogla biti od velike pomoći za vas. To vam može dati ideje "
"što bi promatrali na datum, vrijeme i mjesto koje ste odredili pomoću tipke "
"konfiguracije u gornjem desnom uglu <guilabel>Šta&apos; ima večeras</"
"guilabel> prozor."

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is how the <guilabel>Execution Session</guilabel> Window look. It can "
"be opened by pressing <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>2</keycap></"
"keycombo>. In it you can also see some information about the selected object "
"and you are able to add observing notes."
msgstr ""
"To je kako  <guilabel> Izvrši sesiju </guilabel> Prozor izgled. To se može "
"otvoriti pritiskom na <keycombo action = \"simul\"> &Ctrl; <keycap> 2 </"
"keycap> </keycombo>. U njemu također možete vidjeti neke informacije o "
"odabranom objektu, a vi ste u mogućnosti dodavati promatranja bilješke."

#. Tag: phrase
#: obsplanner.docbook:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "First Execute Session window"
msgstr "Prva obavljena sesija prozor"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By pressing the <guibutton>Next Page</guibutton> button you will access the "
"second page of Session Plan. Here you are able to see information not about "
"your object, but about your equipment."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskom na <guibutton> Sljedeća stranica </guibutton> gumb ćete pristupiti "
"drugu stranicu Plana sesije. Ovdje ste u mogućnosti da vidite informacije ne "
"o svom predmetu, već o svojoj opremi."

#. Tag: phrase
#: obsplanner.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "Second Execute Session window"
msgstr "Druga Izvršena sesija prozora"

#. Tag: para
#: obsplanner.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Pressing the <guibutton>Next Target</guibutton> button will cause the "
"Execute Session to open the first window about the next object."
msgstr ""
"Pritiskanjem  <guibutton>Naredna Meta</guibutton> dugmenta će uraditi "
"Izvršavanje sesije otvori prvi prozor o narednom objektu."
